            <ArticleTitle>Clinical imaging rounds: hypertension in a postpartum patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>469-72</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report a case of a 26-year-old female with gestational headaches, hypertension, weight loss, and tachycardia. Symptoms continued postpartum and a hypertensive workup revealed an adrenal mass and elevated catecholamines.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
